{"thread":{"threadID":5014,"boardID":116,"topic":"Weihnachtsevent 5-fach Stamm / 2-fach Credits","time":1514070318,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","lastPostTime":1514223545,"lastPoster":"Twiix1","replies":10,"views":335,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":9},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":74695,"threadID":5014,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"Weihnachtsevent 5-fach Stamm / 2-fach Credits","time":1514070318,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":9,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2648,"username":"Winnie","time":1514071172,"value":1},{"userID":2770,"username":"Ventex","time":1514071379,"value":1},{"userID":2574,"username":"Linksanwalt","time":1514075042,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1514075980,"value":1},{"userID":2542,"username":"Twiix1","time":1514105649,"value":1},{"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","time":1514115045,"value":1},{"userID":2053,"username":"coldenes","time":1514119232,"value":1},{"userID":1657,"username":"ViruszZ","time":1514121321,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1514130916,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Liebe Community,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>im Namen des gesamten <em>Dream-Teams, </em>darf ich euch ein schönes &amp; besinnliches Weihnachtsfest und ein paar hoffentlich entspannte Feiertage wünschen.<br>Als kleines Dankeschön wird über die Zeit der Weihnachtsfeiertage (24. bis einschließlich 26. Dezember ein Stamm und Credit Event für euch laufen, bei dem ihr ordentlich punkten könnt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Über den genannten Zeitraum erhaltet ihr die fünffache Menge an Stammpunkten sowie die doppelte Menge an Credits!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir wünschen viel Spaß &amp; ein schönes Fest.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74696,"threadID":5014,"userID":2770,"username":"Ventex","subject":"","time":1514070674,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"e